│  Final Answer:                                                                                        │
│  As the Head Caterer for your upcoming event, I have carefully reviewed the dietary requirements of   │
│  all six attendees: Alice (Vegetarian), Bob (Carnivore), Charlie (Gluten-Free), David (No             │
│  restrictions), Eve (Vegan), and Fiona (Pescatarian).                                                 │
│                                                                                                       │
│  To ensure every guest is safely and appropriately fed, I have designed a modular menu. Each          │
│  component is prepared with strict cross-contamination protocols to satisfy the gluten-free           │
│  requirement, and all items are clearly labeled for dietary compliance.                               │
│                                                                                                       │
│  ### **Event Menu**                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                       │
│  **Appetizer: The Garden & The Sea Platter (Served Individually)**                                    │
│  *   **For the Table:** A vibrant display of crudité and house-made hummus (Vegan, Vegetarian,        │
│  Gluten-Free).                                                                                        │
│  *   **For the Pescatarian (Fiona):** Chilled poached shrimp with a zesty lemon-dill vinaigrette      │
│  (Gluten-Free, Pescatarian).                                                                          │
│  *   **For the Carnivore (Bob):** Slow-roasted, herb-rubbed beef tenderloin slices, served chilled    │
│  (Carnivore-compliant, Gluten-Free).                                                                  │
│                                                                                                       │
│  **Main Course Options (Guests to select from):**                                                     │
│  1.  **The Carnivore’s Selection (Bob):** 12oz Grass-fed Ribeye steak, pan-seared in butter and sea   │
│  salt. *Note: Strictly meat only; no side dishes.*                                                    │
│  2.  **The Vegan & Vegetarian Entrée (Alice, Eve, David):** Roasted Cauliflower Steak served over a   │
│  bed of quinoa and lentil pilaf with a roasted red pepper coulis (Vegan, Vegetarian, Gluten-Free).    │
│  3.  **The Pescatarian Entrée (Fiona):** Pan-seared Wild Salmon served with a side of steamed         │
│  asparagus and lemon wedges (Pescatarian, Gluten-Free).                                               │
│  4.  **The Gluten-Free Preference (Charlie):** Your choice of the Pescatarian Salmon or the Vegan     │
│  Cauliflower Steak, prepared in a dedicated gluten-free kitchen space to ensure zero                  │
│  cross-contamination.                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                       │
│  **Dessert:**                                                                                         │
│  *   **Vegan/Vegetarian Option:** Dark chocolate mousse topped with fresh raspberries (Vegan,         │
│  Vegetarian, Gluten-Free).                                                                            │
│  *   **Carnivore Option:** A platter of sharp, aged cheddar and Gouda cheeses (Carnivore-compliant,   │
